# The generated desktop bundles are byte-compared against a fresh
# `npm run build` (CI runs `git diff --exit-code`). esbuild always writes LF,
# so the working tree has to keep LF on every platform - a core.autocrlf
# checkout would otherwise hand the build a file it is bound to "change".
*/desktop/plugin.tsx text eol=lf
*/desktop/plugin.js  text eol=lf
